h code. I continuously improve my skills by working on projects and exploring different tools and technologies in software development. My primary interests lie in <strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"644\">software engineering and cybersecurity</strong>, where I aim to build reliable, secure, and well-designed software.</p>',	'Home',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'37-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-08-24 13:38:35',	'2026-08-24 05:38:35',	'',	37,	'http://rzayasportfolio.local/?p=220',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
