s/2026/08/meet_UMDC0-768x432.jpeg 768w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/meet_UMDC0-1536x864.jpeg 1536w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/meet_UMDC0-2048x1152.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />													<p>I am a Computer Science student from the University of Mindanao with a strong interest in programming and web development. I enjoy building applications, learning new technologies, and solving problems through code. I continuously improve my skills by working on projects and exploring different tools and technologies in software development. My primary interests lie in <strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"644\">software engineering and cybersecurity</strong>, where I aim to build reliable, secure, and well-designed software.</p>			<h2>My Recent Projects</h2>		<p>throughout the years 2026</p>					\n								<figure><img src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DLXHotel.png\" alt=\"DLXHotel\" /></figure>',	'Home',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'37-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2026-08-26 00:46:54',	'2026-08-25 16:46:54',	'',	37,	'http://rzayasportfolio.local/?p=272',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
