uploads/2026/08/colab_setup-1024x885.jpeg 1024w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/colab_setup-768x664.jpeg 768w, http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/colab_setup-1536x1327.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px\" />													<p>I am a Computer Science student from the University of Mindanao with a strong interest in programming and web development. I enjoy building applications, learning new technologies, and solving problems through code. I continuously improve my skills by working on projects and exploring different tools and technologies in software development. My primary interests lie in <strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"644\">software engineering and cybersecurity</strong>, where I aim to build reliable, secure, and well-designed software.</p>			<h1>My Recent Projects</h1>		<p>throughout the year 2026</p>					\n								<figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-06-16-132037.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-16 132037\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-24-151234.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-24 151234\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-011442.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-26 011442\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-24-151314.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-24 151314\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"http://rzayasportfolio.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Screenshot-2026-08-26-011428.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-26 011428\" /></figure>			\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 